WEBVTT

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.130
I need you by my side, now and always!

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.630
Vermeil...

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.630
Shiro ka kuro kongaragatte gray

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.830
Itsudatte aimai na mama de

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:13.830
Tayorinaku aruku tonari de hohoenderu kimi

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.290
Akogare wa tashika da toshite

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:20.500
Hateshinaku tooku mabushii

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:26.290
Chippokena kono genjou Abracada-Boo mahou kakete yo

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:32.460
Kimi no hitomi no yami ni kakushita

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:39.130
Samishisa wa yasashii uta de dakishimeteitai no ni

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.830
Sekaijuu ga uso datte sawagihajimetatte

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.630
Kimi ga kimi naraba

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:52.880
Kirameku kaze o makiokoshi shinjitsu o sakebu

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.500
Sekaijuu ga tsumi datte togameta toshitatte

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.210
Tatta hitori demo

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:02.380
Kimi o rikai shi tsuzuketai

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:07.880
I'm on your side mamotte ageru

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.880
<b>CONFESSION</b>

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:15.540
It can't be.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:16.460
No way...

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:17.880
I don't WANT to believe it...

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.000
Professor Obsidian...

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.710
Why did this happen?

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.710
The girls are deep in mourning for Professor Obsidian...

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.380
He sure was popular...

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.630
It's not just the girls.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.130
Wh-why are the boys mourning him?!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.250
We're not mourning him! We're mourning Vermeil!

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.250
Vermeil...

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.580
She's not here to gaze upon today...

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:40.750
Why haven't you been bringing her around lately?!

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.000
Really?!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:47.380
Umm, Vermeil hasn't been feeling well lately...

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.790
Huh? She all right?

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:53.290
Y-yeah, it's no big deal, but she's resting just in case.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.040
Could I have a little alone time?

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.710
Huh? Uh, sure...

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:04.290
I wonder if buying her some dessert
will help cheer her up?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.000
So you're a demon.

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:25.750
Alto told me. I knew you were hiding something.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.830
Yeah...

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.460
I'm sorry for lying to you about who I was.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:37.830
Don't give me that look.
You're making me feel like a big bully.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:39.920
Sorry.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.960
What? Why are YOU apologizing?

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:45.040
Nothing, I just...

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:50.000
I don't care if you're a demon or some floozy.
You don't need to apologize for it...

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.500
It's not that big of a deal, anyway.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.330
I-it's not?

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.830
This is, though!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:01.540
In the last few days, did you do anything weird to Alto?!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.920
I might have.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.420
I thought so.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.420
But whatever. Alto seems to be fine, despite it all.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:22.670
So I'll give you a pass this time!
But just this time, all right?!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.790
Are you not afraid of me?

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:27.960
Why would I be?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.880
Wait, are you going to come after me?
Suck my blood or something?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.670
N-no, nothing of the sort.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.920
Then I've no reason to be afraid of you.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:42.960
I know, but humans like you fear my-

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:43.710
You're an idiot.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:45.830
An idiot!

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.420
Y-you didn't have to say it twice...

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:54.630
Are you seriously feeling bad about being a demon?
That won't make anything better.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.580
I know, but because I'm a demon, Alto got hurt...

00:04:58.580 --> 00:04:59.790
History repeats itself...

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.330
I swear, you're such a mess!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.960
I can't believe I was so worried about a floozy like you.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.500
Who cares if you're a demon?
Who cares if you're powerful?

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:22.250
Demon or human, all that matters
is if you're GOOD or if you're BAD.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.500
What you are doesn't matter.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:29.210
What matters is how you feel about Alto.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.960
How I feel about Alto?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:39.670
That's right. And how Alto feels about you.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:50.210
I know you've got hangups about being a demon,
but give your Master some more credit.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:54.500
If you ever get out of hand again,
Alto will be there to stop you.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.380
You're his familiar. You should lean on him more.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.920
We're all ready to risk our lives at any moment
for the sake of our familiars.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.420
Thank you.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.040
You're welcome.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:25.540
You're actually a pretty decent person.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:28.040
What did you think I was before?!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:35.330
Huh? Where did Vermeil go?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:45.670
She's not here. I know she said she wanted to be alone...

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:52.080
Vermeil! Did you go out by yourself?

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.170
Yeah.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.920
Are you feeling better?

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:58.330
Ah, yeah, I'm fine.

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:03.170
Good. I was worried about you.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:03.960
Alto.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:07.670
I'm...

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.250
I'm home.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.960
Yep! Welcome home.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:20.710
Alto, uh, I...

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:25.290
I'm a demon, and I've done terrible things to you...

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:31.130
But when you said those kind words to me,

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.580
I felt so happy.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:40.540
But if I stay with you, I might hurt you again...

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:48.420
It's happened before, and...
I just didn't know what to say to you.

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:54.790
But despite that, despite everything, I still...

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:58.380
I want to be with you, too!

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:02.130
I know I'm a demon, but I want to be together with you!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.460
Th...

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.080
Thank God...

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:14.080
Wh-why are you relieved to hear that?!

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:21.790
I mean, the other night I went on that big rant,
and I felt like I kinda forced you into saying what you did.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.920
I wasn't sure if you were really happy to have me.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:27.920
But now I know.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:33.960
I'm going to work really hard
to be the best Master for you!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:39.170
Y-you're already the best Master.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.290
You think so?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.290
It's all right, Vermeil.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:53.000
If you need me, lean on me. You're my familiar, after all.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:58.250
If you want me to do something, anything,
just say the word. I'll do what I can!

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.830
Anything at all?

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.920
Yep, anything at all!

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.670
For example, if you wanted a crepe, or donuts!

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.630
I actually stopped by somewhere on my way back...

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.000
I...

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.920
I want to kiss you.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:19.750
Huh?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.580
Wait, Vermeil...

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:45.460
That was all you wanted? But we do this all the time.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.670
I want YOU to kiss ME.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:56.000
Today, I went down to the waterway.
I just wanted to be alone.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.580
But even when I was alone...

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:04.330
I couldn't stop thinking about you.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:27.210
Hey, Alto, is this all right?

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:31.460
How does it fit? I got you the biggest size.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:36.500
W-w-w-w-whoa! At least button up the front!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.960
I would, but it definitely won't.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:44.130
I'm going to die of embarrassment
in front of the Professor again...

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:48.630
For now, I'll lend you a uniform,
so have her wear that instead.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:51.420
I'm so sorry for everything.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:56.630
We'll go shopping for new clothes later.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:11:00.130
You're going to come with me
to school again starting today, yes?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.830
Yes. You need me for some of your classes, after all.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.290
Besides...

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:09.040
I'm your familiar.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.960
And I need your mana!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.040
That's right.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:14.670
All right.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.170
Shall we?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.290
Mm-hmm!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.080
I knew the Professor would fail!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:42.000
I told you there was no point
letting that guy team up with us.

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:50.790
What a right pain they are...

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.920
Oh, nothing, just talking to myself.

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:55.750
I'm busy, so I gotta go.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.670
Sheesh. You're too soft, too, Kohakumiya.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.500
Trying to protect him was such a waste of your time.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:13.830
Still, his research was quite fascinating to observe.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.380
Had he been able to present it to the world,
he might have received our title.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:21.630
That wasn't gonna happen, and you know why, Helio.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:26.420
Shams like that aren't gonna master the art of magic.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.290
Die!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:44.630
Hup!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:50.830
Meh, we've found us a place, so no need for us to rush.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:56.460
We'll be able to handle it on our own.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:58.000
<b>PLATINUM SQUARE                                                                                            </b>

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:58.000
<b>HELIODOR, "THE CONVEYOR"                                                            </b>

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.000
<b>PLATINUM SQUARE (REVOKED)</b>

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.000
<b>IOLITE, "HEAVEN'S WILL"</b>

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:11.040
Even though it's only been a few days,
it feels like forever since I've been here.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:18.080
Why do I feel like I stick out like a sore thumb?
I'm wearing the same uniform now.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.080
Alto!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.670
Thank you!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.670
You're a real genius!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.790
Wait, what?! For what?!

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.380
For EVERYTHING!

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:34.040
I never thought my eyes would be blessed
with the sight of Vermeil in our uniform.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.000
Bless you.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.710
I can die happy.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:37.880
What...?

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:43.380
We were all quite worried, you see.
Now our hearts are at ease.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:46.460
We're glad to see the two of you together again.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:49.670
Thanks, I guess...

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:52.630
So who are those guys grumbling over there?

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:58.380
That's the group who can't decide whether
her old outfit was better. Just leave them be.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.500
Wow...

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.380
In any case, the Bronze exam is swiftly approaching.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.920
Making sure our familiars are in tip-top shape
is part of being a good mage.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:12.500
R-right, I'd forgotten about it
with all the craziness that happened,

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.250
but the Bronze exam's coming up...

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.250
A-all right, Vermeil!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.000
Let's hit the ground running!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:24.460
Right!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:35.420
Wait...

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:45.790
Vermeil, we can't do this here...

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:51.670
Why not? You said we should hit the ground running.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.460
Yeah, but this isn't that!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.540
I'd say it is.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:00.290
I'll need more mana than ever
if we're to hit the ground running.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.920
Or are you saying...

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:06.290
You don't LIKE kissing me?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.670
F-fine!

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.040
Just one more, all right?

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:17.250
Mwwaaaaah~!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.130
I'm such a push-over...

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:26.880
Hey, where've you been? Class is about to start!

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:29.290
Uh, I forgot something?

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:35.580
Get your act together! And don't think
you can use that as an excuse to slack off!

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.750
Why's it so noisy over there?

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.330
I don't know.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.080
Wh-why are they here?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.040
That's the second-years' classroom!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.540
Alto, isn't that...?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:52.130
Class 2-A... If I'm not mistaken.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.380
We don't mean to interfere with your class.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.330
We'll take care of our business quickly.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:00.920
Oh, good, you're together.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:11.830
Alto Goldfield, under the rights and permissions
granted to me as a student council executive,

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.130
I hereby take you into our custody.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.710
Would you... accompany us?

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.250
Calm down.

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:38.790
We don't know if they've found out Vermeil is a demon.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:42.380
If they have, though...

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.830
I'm going to protect her!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:52.630
So... what is it you need?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.630
Right. First, an apology.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:57.290
Huh?

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:02.670
During the incident, you suffered an injury
that required you to be hospitalized.

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:05.880
This injury was a direct result of our inability to prevent it.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.080
Huh? No, it wasn't...

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.460
That, and we still lack information on why this happened.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:18.250
We don't know who it was I engaged in combat.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:24.880
And we are now unable to ask Professor Obsidian
for details of the incident.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:25.630
Huh?

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:32.000
Yesterday, Obsidian escaped
from the Ortigia Arcane Jail.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.000
Professor Obsidian escaped?!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.920
You fought against him in his transformed form.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:45.130
If there is anything you can tell us about him,
however small, we would be grateful for the information.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.630
Wow. I thought this was going to go differently...

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.670
Maybe I don't need to worry right now.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.670
Yes, of course! I'll tell you everything I can!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:56.790
Thank you.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:01.420
Shifting to a slightly different topic...

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:09.170
...is there anything you're hiding from us?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:18.790
Choose your next words very carefully, Alto Goldfield.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:21.960
I let my guard down.

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:23.710
That bastard!

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:31.500
You really think something like this
will be able to stop me?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.460
I don't.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.540
I only need to slow you down for a few brief seconds.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:40.920
That will be enough time to incapacitate your master.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.210
I will ask you one last time.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:49.040
Is there anything you're hiding from us?

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.880
No, there-

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:54.630
Alto.

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:06.790
Vermeil...

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.420
...is a demon.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.330
Is that so?

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:25.710
You have a demon's heart?

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:30.540
Unbelievable. You made a contract with a DEMON?

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:34.960
Yes, and I kept quiet about it. I'm sorry.

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:36.330
But you've got it all wrong!

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:37.080
Hey!

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:40.250
Vermeil might be a demon, but she's not a BAD demon!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:43.630
And what happened with her before wasn't her fault!

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:46.630
So please, I don't care what happens to me!

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:50.420
If I can't be a student anymore, then fine, expel me!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.290
Alto, but then-

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.080
I don't care.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:58.210
You're right. At first, I only summoned you
to advance a grade.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:02.420
But right now, you're more important than school.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.920
I can make my dream come true another way.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:12.630
And if that doesn't work, then it means
I never deserved it in the first place.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.670
I am Vermeil's master.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:23.710
And if someone wants to harm my familiar, I'll oppose
them with all I have, even if that someone is all of you.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.420
You seem to be misunderstanding me.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:34.830
I've no intention of interfering with either of you.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:35.790
Huh?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:41.000
You won't be expelled.
We won't even inform the professors.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.710
Madam President, you cannot-

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:44.750
You may do as you please.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:49.040
A demon... This may work in our favor.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:54.630
After all, one of our school's principles
is "All Familiars are Equal."

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:59.210
I agree with the President.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:00.380
Shinouji!

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:03.920
One perpetrator of this incident
was a member of our faculty.

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:09.750
Until we ascertain the identity
of the other perpetrators, we cannot trust our faculty.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:14.460
Still, she's a demon! She's far too dangerous!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.500
No need to worry, Jessica.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:22.670
You heard their story just now. Their lives are intertwined.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:28.750
If necessary, I merely need to behead him.

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:34.420
All right, Madam President.

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.580
What are you plotting?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:49.130
Nothing. I just believe you two to be trustworthy.

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:53.830
I did tell you that you may do as you please, yes?

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:58.580
If you say she's not a danger, then I believe you.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:03.250
Right then, Alto Goldfield.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:09.130
Would you like to join the Executive Committee
of the Student Council?

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:22.580
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:33.290
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.710
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.920
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.670
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.960
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:59.630
The world is too slow to understand

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:03.210
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.750
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:11.130
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.460
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.920
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:26.460
All I ever knew have become distant past
